{"type":"message","id":"543859f8","parentId":"9c51e652","timestamp":"2026-04-14T00:45:15.814Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9e362fde3c8d49ea8d38ed1b","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这张图片展示了一份带有编号的列表，内容似乎是关于工作内容或任务分类。主要有以下几个部分：\n\n**顶部标题：**\n*   \"4-deep-research (多来源综合深度研究)\"\n\n**第二部分：开发工作**\n*   \"二、开发工作\"\n    *   \"1. product-spec-builder (毒蛇产品经理)\"\n    *   \"2. ui-prompt-generator (UI提示词设计师)\"\n    *   \"3. ui-ux-pro-max (UI/UX设计智能)\"\n    *   \"4. dev-builder (全栈开发工程师)\"\n\n**第三部分：文字工作**\n*   \"三、文字工作\"\n    *   \"1. brainstorming (九步探索头脑风暴)\"\n    *   \"2. minimax-docx、pdf、xlsx (加强版办公三件套)\"\n    *   \"3. ppt-generator (专业的PPT设计)\"\n    *   \"4. humanizer-zh (去除AI写作痕迹)\"\n\n整个列表以中文和英文结合的形式呈现，并且在中文部分有一些括号内的补充说明，解释了对应英文术语可能代表的含义或具体功能。背景色为黄色，文字颜色则有黑色、蓝色和绿色。"}],"details":{"model":"google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite","image":"/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/2f4f430a-ee52-4f32-b0ee-ce90e9025585.jpg","attempts":[{"provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"ark-code-latest","error":"Unknown model: volcengine-plan/ark-code-latest | Unknown model: volcengine-plan/ark-code-latest"},{"provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","error":"Image model failed (openai/gpt-5.4-mini): You exceeded your current quota, please check your plan and billing details. For more information on this error, read the docs: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/error-codes/api-errors. | Image model failed (openai/gpt-5.4-mini): You exceeded your current quota, please check your plan and billing details. For more information on this error, read the docs: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/error-codes/api-errors."}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776127515806}}
{"type":"message","id":"c802928d","parentId":"543859f8","timestamp":"2026-04-14T00:45:24.717Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户发送了一张图片，内容是某个AI Agent系统的功能列表。我来描述一下我看到的内容，并询问用户需要什么帮助。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"开发者好！🔗\n\n我看到这是一份 **AI Agent 功能列表**，包含了以下几个板块：\n\n---\n\n### 一、多来源综合深度研究\n- `deep-research` - 深度研究能力\n\n### 二、开发工作\n1. `product-spec-builder` - 毒蛇产品经理\n2. `ui-prompt-generator` - UI提示词设计师\n3. `ui-ux-pro-max` - UI/UX设计智能\n4. `dev-builder` - 全栈开发工程师\n\n### 三、文字工作\n1. `brainstorming` - 九步探索头脑风暴\n2. `minimax-docx/pdf/xlsx` - 加强版办公三件套\n3. `ppt-generator` - 专业的PPT设计\n4. `humanizer-zh` - 去除AI写作痕迹\n\n---\n\n看起来这是一个 AI Agent 工具集的功能清单。请问开发者：\n\n1. **你想让我做什么？** 比如：\n   - 评估这些 Agent 的能力？\n   - 帮你实现其中某个 Agent？\n   - 还是有其他需求？\n\n2. **图片中的「毒蛇产品经理」是什么意思？** 是某个特定项目的内部代号吗？\n\n请告诉我你的具体需求，我来帮你分析或实现！ 🛠️"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"minimax-m2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776127515815,"responseId":"021776127515910fe9f6125f2b74cd477deac452ba6a965ea22fe"}}
