{"type":"message","id":"d35c63d3","parentId":"521d11e4","timestamp":"2026-04-14T00:45:42.716Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户想让我查看这个图片中的几个skills。根据图片内容，我看到了：\n\n1. deep-research (多来源综合深度研究)\n2. product-spec-builder (毒蛇产品经理)\n3. ui-prompt-generator (UI提示词设计师)\n4. ui-ux-pro-max (UI/UX设计智能)\n5. dev-builder (全栈开发工程师)\n6. brainstorming (九步探索头脑风暴)\n7. minimax-docx/pdf/xlsx (加强版办公三件套)\n8. ppt-generator (专业的PPT设计)\n9. humanizer-zh (去除AI写作痕迹)\n\n用户说的是\"几个skills\"，可能是想让我检查这些是否在 OpenClaw 的可用 skills 列表中。让我查看一下可用的 skills。\n\n从系统提示中我可以看到有这些 skills:\n- feishu-doc\n- feishu-drive\n- feishu-perm\n- feishu-wiki\n- tavily\n- healthcheck\n- model-usage\n- node-connect\n- skill-creator\n- taskflow\n- taskflow-inbox-triage\n- weather\n- Agent Browser\n- automation-workflows\n- EnvGuard Secret & Credential Scanner\n- find-skills\n- freeride\n- nano-banana-pro\n- ontology\n- openclaw-free-models\n- react-expert\n- self-improvement\n- skill-vetter\n\n图片中的 skills 看起来不是直接对应这些。让我搜索一下看看有没有相关的。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来帮你查看这个图片中列出的几个 skills：\n"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"minimax-m2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776127533138,"responseId":"021776127533231fe9f6125f2b74cd477deac452ba6a9659dbba0"}}
