{"type":"message","id":"8a1c4bae","parentId":"7a3ce21f","timestamp":"2026-04-14T01:46:25.660Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_458fbfb9eb1f4925adbad774","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"MiniMax M2.7 open source model HuggingFace\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1076,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8a4f681ff398a2f8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.7 · Hugging Face\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8a4f681ff398a2f8\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d49e6784a6607be8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWe're on a journey to advance and democratize artificial intelligence through open source and open science.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d49e6784a6607be8\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"huggingface.co\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"99920c3a67674b8a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGitHub - MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-M2.7\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"99920c3a67674b8a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1df382ade3f8916a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMiniMax-M2.7 is our first model deeply participating in its own evolution. M2.7 is capable of building complex agent harnesses and completing highly elaborate productivity tasks, leveraging Agent Teams, complex Skills, and dynamic tool search. For more details, see our blog post.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1df382ade3f8916a\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"github.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"30b7676c19d3729d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMiniMax-M2.7 - How to Run Locally | Unsloth Documentation\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"30b7676c19d3729d\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://unsloth.ai/docs/models/minimax-m27\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"565f7598d6b332a0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMiniMax-M2.7 - How to Run Locally Run MiniMax-M2.7 LLM locally on your own device! MiniMax-M2.7 is a new open model for agentic coding and chat use-cases. The model achieves SOTA performance in SWE-Pro (56.22%) and Terminal Bench 2 (57.0%). The 230B parameters (10B active) model is the successor to MiniMax -M25 and has a 200K context window.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"565f7598d6b332a0\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"unsloth.ai\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b38e63632d651320\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMiniMax Releases M2.7 as Open Weights on HuggingFace\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b38e63632d651320\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://aiproductivity.ai/news/minimax-m2-7-open-weights-release/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b7726404ffd014f7\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMiniMax just dropped M2.7 as open weights on HuggingFace , giving the local AI community direct access to download, run, and modify the model without paying API fees or dealing with usage caps. MiniMax is a Chinese AI company that has been building large multimodal models - systems trained to handle text, images, and video together.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b7726404ffd014f7\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"aiproductivity.ai\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9715396766a267a1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMiniMax Just Open Sourced MiniMax M2.7: A Self-Evolving Agent Model ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9715396766a267a1\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/04/12/minimax-just-open-sourced-minimax-m2-7-a-self-evolving-agent-model-that-scores-56-22-on-swe-pro-and-57-0-on-terminal-bench-2/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ccf7a77660aec573\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nKey Takeaways MiniMax M2.7 is now officially open source , with weights available on Hugging Face, making a frontier-grade agentic model freely accessible for developers to deploy and build on.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ccf7a77660aec573\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.marktechpost.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"MiniMax M2.7 open source model HuggingFace","provider":"duckduckgo","count":5,"tookMs":1076,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"duckduckgo","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"8a4f681ff398a2f8\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.7 · Hugging Face\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"8a4f681ff398a2f8\">>>","url":"https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.7","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d49e6784a6607be8\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWe're on a journey to advance and democratize artificial intelligence through open source and open science.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d49e6784a6607be8\">>>","siteName":"huggingface.co"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"99920c3a67674b8a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nGitHub - MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-M2.7\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"99920c3a67674b8a\">>>","url":"https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-M2.7","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1df382ade3f8916a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMiniMax-M2.7 is our first model deeply participating in its own evolution. M2.7 is capable of building complex agent harnesses and completing highly elaborate productivity tasks, leveraging Agent Teams, complex Skills, and dynamic tool search. For more details, see our blog post.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1df382ade3f8916a\">>>","siteName":"github.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"30b7676c19d3729d\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMiniMax-M2.7 - How to Run Locally | Unsloth Documentation\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"30b7676c19d3729d\">>>","url":"https://unsloth.ai/docs/models/minimax-m27","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"565f7598d6b332a0\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMiniMax-M2.7 - How to Run Locally Run MiniMax-M2.7 LLM locally on your own device! MiniMax-M2.7 is a new open model for agentic coding and chat use-cases. The model achieves SOTA performance in SWE-Pro (56.22%) and Terminal Bench 2 (57.0%). The 230B parameters (10B active) model is the successor to MiniMax -M25 and has a 200K context window.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"565f7598d6b332a0\">>>","siteName":"unsloth.ai"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b38e63632d651320\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMiniMax Releases M2.7 as Open Weights on HuggingFace\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b38e63632d651320\">>>","url":"https://aiproductivity.ai/news/minimax-m2-7-open-weights-release/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b7726404ffd014f7\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMiniMax just dropped M2.7 as open weights on HuggingFace , giving the local AI community direct access to download, run, and modify the model without paying API fees or dealing with usage caps. MiniMax is a Chinese AI company that has been building large multimodal models - systems trained to handle text, images, and video together.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b7726404ffd014f7\">>>","siteName":"aiproductivity.ai"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9715396766a267a1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMiniMax Just Open Sourced MiniMax M2.7: A Self-Evolving Agent Model ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9715396766a267a1\">>>","url":"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/04/12/minimax-just-open-sourced-minimax-m2-7-a-self-evolving-agent-model-that-scores-56-22-on-swe-pro-and-57-0-on-terminal-bench-2/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ccf7a77660aec573\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nKey Takeaways MiniMax M2.7 is now officially open source , with weights available on Hugging Face, making a frontier-grade agentic model freely accessible for developers to deploy and build on.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ccf7a77660aec573\">>>","siteName":"www.marktechpost.com"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776131185659}}
{"type":"message","id":"d57ec22b","parentId":"8a1c4bae","timestamp":"2026-04-14T01:46:45.189Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"开发者说得对！MiniMax M2.7 确实已经开源了（open weights），在 HuggingFace 上可以下载：https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.7\n\n但是问题是：\n1. **开源 ≠ 免费 API** - 开源是指模型权重可以下载自托管，但通过 API 调用仍然是付费的\n2. **OpenClaw 的 FreeRide 主要是通过 OpenRouter 提供免费 API**，而 OpenRouter 上目前没有 MiniMax M2.7 的免费端点\n3. **本地运行需要 GPU 资源** - M2.7 是 230B 参数（10B active），需要大量显存\n\n让我给开发者解释清楚这个区别。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"你说得对！M2.7 确实已经开源了 🎉\n\n---\n\n## 📦 MiniMax M2.7 开源情况\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **模型权重** | ✅ HuggingFace 可下载 |\n| **GitHub** | ✅ github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-M2.7 |\n| **参数** | 230B (10B active) |\n| **上下文** | 200K tokens |\n| **性能** | SWE-Pro 56.22%, Terminal Bench 2 57.0% |\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 但开源 ≠ 免费 API\n\n| 方式 | 费用 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **API 调用** | 💰 付费 | 通过 minimaxi.com 调用 |\n| **自托管** | ⚡ 需要 GPU | 本地运行，显卡成本 |\n| **OpenRouter 免费** | ❌ 暂无 | 目前没有 M2.7 免费端点 |\n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ 在 OpenClaw 中使用 M2.7\n\n### 方案 1：API 付费调用\n```bash\n# 需要 MiniMax API Key\nopenclaw config set auth.minimax:cn.api_key \"your-key\"\n```\n\n### 方案 2：本地自托管（需要 GPU）\n```bash\n# 通过 Ollama 或 vLLM 本地部署\n# 但需要 80GB+ 显存运行\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📊 对比\n\n| 模型 | OpenClaw 可用? | 费用 |\n|------|---------------|------|\n| M2.5 (火山引擎) | ✅ 已有配置 | 免费 |\n| M2.7 (API) | ✅ 可配置 | 付费 |\n| M2.7 (本地) | ⚠️ 需要 GPU | 硬件成本 |\n\n---\n\n**总结**：M2.7 开源了权重，但 **FreeRide 免费 API 列表里暂时没有**，因为 OpenRouter 还没接入。如果你想本地部署跑，需要大显存显卡。\n\n你本地有 GPU 吗？或者想直接配置 M2.7 API 来测试？ 🛠️"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"minimax-m2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776131185662,"responseId":"021776131185760fe9f6125f2b74cd477deac452ba6a965cb5d8b"}}
